<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets 300 bln lire five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets 300 bln lire five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris (books), Caboto, Dresdner Bank and San Paolo (books).</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    02.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.795   PAY DATE    02.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
